    "The paired tournament seed remains the independent comparison unit, n36. Stage match means are descriptive, not new independent observations or new hypothesis tests.",
    "Bracket advance is determined by later participation, not shared match place. Actual elimination stage comes from the last bracket participated in only after excluding Swiss-cut/final/crown outcomes.",
    "Bracket/final and opponent-kind summaries condition on reaching those stages. A/B reach different subsets, so subgroup differences are not paired causal effects.",
    "Final game shared wins differ from the actual three-game aggregate crown. Final margins are reconstructed only from recorded finalist aggregates.",
    "Balances are final per-match currency, not terminal score. Remaining rack face value is unavailable.",
    "No thresholds are recomputed or relaxed; the locked gate and earlier failed raw-score gate are unchanged. Unknown-field generalization and native/network performance remain outside this diagnosis."
